# This package needs no server-side API key: the priceoverview endpoint is
# public, and the pricehistory endpoint takes a caller-supplied cookie per
# call (see the SDK's getPriceHistory `cookie` parameter and the README).
#
# This variable is entirely optional and is NOT read by this package itself.
# It's here only as a suggested convention for a consuming application that
# wants to store your own personal steamcommunity.com session cookie locally
# for local testing/scripts. This is YOUR OWN session value (obtained from
# your browser's DevTools), not a real secret to be provisioned centrally —
# never commit an actual value here.
# STEAM_LOGIN_SECURE=your-own-steamLoginSecure-cookie-value
